ssage": "Fix matching of connection password (broken since version 2.0)\n\nFixes #47.", "created_at": "2021-08-21T11:58:07Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3a998fd41a0052fafb416705452edd1b6139ec0", "message": "Correct chroot jail examples to use --channel-log-dir", "created_at": "2021-04-06T17:07:22Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6473c51c989cfe23c99d12ad16ecb1abe585ac6", "message": "Prepare for version 2.1", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:33:32Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "daeece25d03cef4bc8567c5e8222bba49b443dd9", "message": "Update changelog", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:33:32Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f8b28d2dcfaf98d88ef1d701406af6db0f1f689", "message": "Improve README", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:20:41Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e5994bcba2c41578ee6e795a7132067d8719421e", "message": "Improve development instructions\n\n- Use a virtual environment instead of installing stuff globally (which\n  doesn\u2019t work on my system anyway).\n- Remove potentially confusing prompt characters from commands.", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:17:49Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "73249e6865b29bd41409fe0411257cc4a088806b", "message": "Quote square brackets to avoid globbing\n\nSome shells with saner behavior than bash (e.g. zsh) don\u2019t allow globs\nthat don\u2019t match anything:\n\n    % pip install -e .[dev]\n    zsh: no matches found: .[dev]\n\n(It\u2019s a bad habit to don\u2019t quote glob characters since commands\notherwise will give unexpected results when there is a local file that\ndoes match the pattern.)", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:13:49Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "01b918184a3f7ece51f07dd7322289dd75913f08", "message": "Fix bad syntax in setup.cfg\n\nThe double quotes are apparently interpreted literally:\n\n    HTTPError: 400 Bad Request from https://upload.pypi.org/legacy/\n    '\"https://github.com/jrosdahl/miniircd\"' is an invalid value for Home-Page. Error: Invalid URI See https://packaging.python.org/specifications/core-metadata for more information.", "created_at": "2021-03-08T19:09:22Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51c1708c25133d536ae8296e15eeca127e0e128e", "message": "Extract developer instructions to a separate file\n\nREADME.md is intended for end users so I think it\u2019s good to move\ninformation they don\u2019t need elsewhere.", "created_at": "2021-03-08T18:45:29Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "590179623d950bd1cf745cc65af3bf914e502a91", "message": "Add John Andersen as contributor", "created_at": "2021-03-08T18:38:40Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6cd8dd7fec851369070a5d0ac67b18620ea0715c", "message": "Add Leonardo Taccari as contributor", "created_at": "2021-02-28T10:43:14Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d2717e41731c6c95549979cbc73c31bb85de060", "message": "Improve README", "created_at": "2021-02-28T10:43:14Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07ea0624185b57e8b62402920ced6a2e17daf1fc", "message": "Add --ssl-cert-file and --ssl-key-file arguments\n\nCloses #44.", "created_at": "2021-02-25T20:34:56Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "38f22c6f55c6727cc80c215c2093ceaa134804a4", "message": "Only construct debug log strings in debug mode", "created_at": "2020-07-21T11:09:39Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a6ef112e1781e3a618685321f78ca15b5e224eb", "message": "Simplify Client.__init__ setup code", "created_at": "2020-07-21T11:07:27Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "550079db1c1652e755b3996f4216cfc38d583d9f", "message": "Don\u2019t import modules twice", "created_at": "2020-07-20T11:55:06Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "545a6949ce26edcf3d541f5d14489549e6a31aa6", "message": "Set version 2.0", "created_at": "2020-07-16T11:48:28Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "93297603fa70423f2c83f58d3dd23435a277e322", "message": "Use argparse instead of deprecated optparse", "created_at": "2020-07-16T11:48:03Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1eb886ca86a36b785a4d15213358c2140740b2b8", "message": "Drop Python 2 support and add type hints\n\n- Dropped Python 2 support and bumped Python 3 requirement to 3.6+.\n- miniircd now works with bytes instead of strings internally. This\n  fixes #41 (problem with reading and writing non-ASCII text in Python 3\n  mode).\n- Added type annotations to aid the conversion to use bytes internally.\n  Verified by use of Mypy.", "created_at": "2020-07-16T11:47:25Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9429c6d1bd2c82edf62b859c0608ed93dc86124", "message": "Format code with Black", "created_at": "2020-07-15T17:25:38Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3070b4c094a23809461d3d5d501c44423d84042e", "message": "Fix creation of PID file with a relative path\n\nFixes #40.", "created_at": "2019-08-21T20:16:38Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "313a00e535ee5424e62ce3105f27669ac8798bfc", "message": "Fix invalid escape sequence", "created_at": "2019-08-13T18:16:12Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6de19786328995f4f8257b415996977899892a3e", "message": "Remove unused variable", "created_at": "2019-08-13T18:16:09Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "019580654745671e5376e294dbdb03e7b88e3335", "message": "Avoid catch-all except clauses\n\nThey catch exceptions like KeyboardInterrupt.", "created_at": "2019-08-13T18:16:09Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "18807e2f1ea892cb6f0bd53544307d495cbcc18a", "message": "Update changelog and list of contributors", "created_at": "2019-08-13T18:13:12Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c83ce1b15e89ee793f1ffbca154b3e31537545c1", "message": "Use lowercase channel log names\n\nThis will store logs for e.g. #test, #Test and #TEST in the same file.\n\nSuggested by Hanno Foest.", "created_at": "2019-04-22T03:21:37Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "013ff21c0f8dc35099c5eb0fb2813b9f620a02d8", "message": "Tweak CHANGES", "created_at": "2019-04-22T03:21:19Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e9d818b079cf7cb6939264168cb11208edd0f4a", "message": "Delete obsolete COPYING file", "created_at": "2019-03-21T20:22:28Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f673264c0c8dfb76a3fd61fcd8a2041f6080c9a", "message": "Prepare for v1.3", "created_at": "2019-03-12T19:36:54Z", "repo": "miniircd", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_